    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        671.3331909179688,
        427.033935546875,
        685.0371704101562
      ],
      "text": "Tracers refer to communication with the patient including via SMS, telephone (voice) calls, or home visit. 40",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        683.7679443359375,
        526.7692260742188,
        697.471923828125
      ],
      "text": "A digital medication monitor is a device that can measure the time between openings of the pill box. The medication monitor may have  41",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 7.994548320770264,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        81.86609649658203,
        696.5678100585938,
        487.07904052734375,
        707.07177734375
      ],
      "text": "audio reminders or send an SMS to remind patient to take medications, along with recording when the pill box is opened.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        705.8025512695312,
        526.6103515625,
        719.5064697265625
      ],
      "text": "Material support can be food or financial support such as: meals, food baskets, food supplements, food vouchers, transport subsidies,  42",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        81.86609649658203,
        718.6025390625,
        526.6073608398438,
        729.1065063476562
      ],
      "text": "living allowance, housing incentives, or financial bonus. This support addresses indirect costs incurred by patients or their attendants",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        81.86609649658203,
        728.2025146484375,
        466.474853515625,
        738.7064819335938
      ],
      "text": "in order to access health services, and possibly tries to mitigate consequences of income loss related to the disease.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        737.4371337890625,
        327.93603515625,
        751.14111328125
      ],
      "text": "Psychological support can be counselling sessions or peer-group support. 43",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
